<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#120f20">
  <meta name="description" content="Anmol's personal corner of the internet — tech, creativity, projects, and little things I love.">
  <title>Anmol's Little Corner ♡</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #100d1d;
      --panel: #1b162b;
      --panel-light: #251d38;
      --ink: #fff5f8;
      --muted: #c9bfd7;
      --pink: #ff9ec8;
      --lavender: #c5b4ff;
      --line: rgba(255, 208, 231, .2);
      --max: 1120px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 90px; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 5%, rgba(139, 92, 246, .15), transparent 38rem),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 95% 40%, rgba(255, 158, 200, .10), transparent 34rem),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: "Trebuchet MS", Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--pink); outline-offset: 4px; }
    img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }

    .site-nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 16px max(24px, calc((100vw - var(--max)) / 2));
      background: rgba(16, 13, 29, .9);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    }
    .brand {
      color: var(--pink);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: clamp(12px, 2.5vw, 28px);
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .94rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: color .2s ease;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--pink); }

    .wrap { width: min(var(--max), calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }
    section { padding: 100px 0; position: relative; }
    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--pink);
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }
    h1 {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.3rem);
      line-height: .98;
      letter-spacing: -.065em;
    }
    h1 span, h2 span { color: var(--pink); }
    h2 {
      margin: 10px 0 20px;
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
    }
    .lead { max-width: 650px; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.2rem); }
    .hero { min-height: calc(100svh - 68px); display: grid; align-items: center; padding: 70px 0 90px; }
    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(250px, .7fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(34px, 7vw, 90px); }
    .hero-copy { min-width: 0; }
    .hero-image-wrap { position: relative; width: min(100%, 350px); justify-self: center; }
    .hero-image-wrap::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 14px -14px -14px 14px;
      border: 2px solid var(--pink);
      border-radius: 28px;
      transform: rotate(4deg);
    }
    .hero-image {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center 35%;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 28px;
      background: var(--panel);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, .3);
    }
    .image-caption {
      position: relative;
      display: table;
      margin: 20px auto 0;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: .85rem;
    }
    .tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin: 26px 0; }
    .tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 8px 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(37, 29, 56, .72);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: .88rem;
    }
    .button-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 11px 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--pink);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--pink);
      color: #251329;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 900;
      transition: transform .2s ease, background .2s ease;
    }
    .button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .button.secondary { color: var(--ink); background: transparent; border-color: var(--line); }

    .section-rule { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .about-card, .project-card, .fun-card, .contact-card {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(37, 29, 56, .92), rgba(27, 22, 43, .92));
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 42px);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 55px rgba(0, 0, 0, .12);
    }
    .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; }
    .about-card p, .project-card p, .fun-card p, .contact-card p { color: var(--muted); }
    .mini-heading { color: var(--lavender); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .project-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
    .project-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 54px; height: 54px; margin-bottom: 18px; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(255, 158, 200, .12); font-size: 1.6rem; }
    .project-card h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .project-card .small-link { color: var(--pink); font-weight: 800; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
    .fun-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
    .fun-card { padding: 22px; }
    .fun-card .emoji { font-size: 1.8rem; }
    .contact-card { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; }
    .contact-card p { margin-bottom: 0; }
    footer { padding: 26px 0 34px; color: var(--muted); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: center; font-size: .9rem; }
    .back-top { color: var(--pink); text-decoration: none; }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .site-nav { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 14px 22px; }
      .nav-links { justify-content: flex-start; gap: 10px 20px; }
      .hero { min-height: auto; }
      .hero-grid, .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-image-wrap { width: min(72%, 300px); margin-top: 10px; }
      section { padding: 74px 0; }
      .project-grid, .fun-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .contact-card { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      *, *::before, *::after { transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
    <a class="brand" href="#home">♡ ANMOL'S CORNER</a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
      <li><a href="#little-things">Little things</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home" aria-labelledby="home-title">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow">A little corner of the internet ✦</div>
          <h1 id="home-title">Hey, I'm <span>Anmol.</span></h1>
          <p class="lead">Welcome to my little corner! I'm curious about computers, learning to code, and always making room for creativity, video editing, music, and random ideas.</p>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag">💻 Tech lover</span>
            <span class="tag">🎬 Video editor</span>
            <span class="tag">🎧 Music on repeat</span>
          </div>
          <div class="button-row">
            <a class="button" href="#about">Get to know me ↓</a>
            <a class="button secondary" href="#projects">See my projects</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image-wrap">
          <img class="hero-image" src="anmol.jpg" alt="Anmol as a young child wearing a school uniform and a hat" width="640" height="800">
          <div class="image-caption">tiny human, big ideas ♡</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-rule" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">A bit about me</div>
        <h2 id="about-title">Curious mind, <span>creative heart.</span></h2>
        <div class="about-grid">
          <article class="about-card">
            <h3 class="mini-heading">Who I am</h3>
            <p>I'm getting started with coding and excited to learn more every day. I love computers, figuring out how things work, and making things that feel like me.</p>
            <p>When I'm not exploring tech, I'm often editing videos, working on creative ideas, or listening to music.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="about-card">
            <h3 class="mini-heading">Things I enjoy</h3>
            <p>Building PCs, experimenting with websites, video editing, gaming, music, and learning new skills one small project at a time.</p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">Learning to code</span>
              <span class="tag">YouTube creator</span>
              <span class="tag">Always curious</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-rule" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">Things I'm making</div>
        <h2 id="projects-title">My <span>projects.</span></h2>
        <div class="project-grid">
          <article class="project-card">
            <div class="project-icon" aria-hidden="true">🌐</div>
            <h3>My personal website</h3>
            <p>This very corner of the internet! Built with HTML and custom CSS, then published with GitHub Pages.</p>
            <a class="small-link" href="#home">Back to the top ↑</a>
          </article>
          <article class="project-card">
            <div class="project-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎞️</div>
            <h3>Video editing experiments</h3>
            <p>I enjoy making videos and trying out new ways to make digital content more engaging. More projects coming soon.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-rule" id="little-things" aria-labelledby="little-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">The fun corner</div>
        <h2 id="little-title">A few little <span>things.</span></h2>
        <div class="fun-grid">
          <article class="fun-card"><div class="emoji" aria-hidden="true">🎧</div><h3>Current vibe</h3><p>Headphones on. World muted. Creativity loading...</p></article>
          <article class="fun-card"><div class="emoji" aria-hidden="true">🛠️</div><h3>Dream activity</h3><p>Taking something apart, learning how it works, and hopefully putting it back together.</p></article>
          <article class="fun-card"><div class="emoji" aria-hidden="true">🐈</div><h3>Important research</h3><p>Why do cats act like they pay rent? Still investigating.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-rule" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="contact-card">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Say hello</div>
            <h2 id="contact-title">Let's make cool <span>stuff.</span></h2>
            <p>Want to talk about tech, creativity, or a project? Find me on Instagram.</p>
          </div>
          <a class="button" href="https://www.instagram.com/anmol.pixelated/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">Made with ♡, curiosity, and a little bit of CSS. <a class="back-top" href="#home">Back to top ↑</a></div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
